ite, and perform tasks on the web with a serverless browser.\" [level=2] [ref=e79]\n        - generic [ref=e80]:\n          - generic [ref=e81]:\n            - link \"Try for free\" [ref=e82] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/sign-up\n              - generic [ref=e83]: Try for free\n            - paragraph [ref=e84]: No credit card required.\n          - link \"Get a demo\" [ref=e85] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /contact\n      - generic [ref=e87]:\n        - heading \"Trusted by AI-first companies worldwide\" [level=4] [ref=e88]\n        - generic [ref=e89]:\n          - img \"Vanta\" [ref=e94]\n          - img \"Perplexity\" [ref=e99]\n          - link \"Numeral\" [ref=e100] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/numeral-automates-sales-tax\n            - img \"Numeral\" [ref=e104]\n          - img \"Clay\" [ref=e109]\n          - link \"Microsoft\" [ref=e110] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/training-computer-use-models-in-the-real-world-with-microsoft\n            - img \"Microsoft\" [ref=e114]\n          - link \"DeepMind\" [ref=e115] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/evaluating-browser-agents\n            - img \"DeepMind\" [ref=e119]\n          - link \"Commure\" [ref=e120] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/case-study-commure\n            - img \"Commure\" [ref=e124]\n          - link \"Vercel\" [ref=e125] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/case-study-vercel\n            - img \"Vercel\" [ref=e129]\n      - generic [ref=e131]:\n        - heading \"Features\" [level=2] [ref=e132]\n        - list [ref=e136]:\n          - listitem [ref=e137]:\n            - button \"Seamless integration Compatible with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, or our own framework, Stagehand. Integrate without changing any of your existing code, just point it at our browsers. Connect natively using the Chrome DevTools Protocol.\" [ref=e138] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e139]:\n                - img [ref=e140]\n                - heading \"Seamless integration\" [level=3] [ref=e142]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e143]: Compatible with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, or our own framework, Stagehand.\n                  - listitem [ref=e144]: Integrate without changing any of your existing code, just point it at our browsers.\n                  - listitem [ref=e145]: Connect natively using the Chrome DevTools Protocol.\n          - listitem [ref=e146]:\n            - button \"Scalable Spin up 1000s of browsers in milliseconds. Serverless infrastructure means you don't need to wait. We'll do the heavy lifting - run your code anywhere.\" [ref=e147] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e148]:\n                - img [ref=e149]\n                - heading \"Scalable\" [level=3] [ref=e151]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e152]: Spin up 1000s of browsers in milliseconds.\n                  - listitem [ref=e153]: Serverless infrastructure means you don't need to wait.\n                  - listitem [ref=e154]: We'll do the heavy lifting - run your code anywhere.\n          - listitem [ref=e155]:\n            - button \"Fast Globally located browsers to minimize latency between the browser and your users. 4 vCPUs for each browser means pages load lightning fast.\" [ref=e156] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e157]:\n                - img [ref=e158]\n                - heading \"Fast\" [level=3] [ref=e160]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e161]: Globally located browsers to minimize latency between the browser and your users.\n                  - listitem [ref=e162]: 4 vCPUs for each browser means pages load lightning fast.\n          - listitem [ref=e163]:\n            - button \"Secure Isolated browser instances to ensure data privacy and security. SOC-2 Type 1 and HIPAA compliant. Self-hosted available for ultimate control. Configurable logging options for maximum control of sensitive data.\" [ref=e164] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e165]:\n                - img [ref=e166]\n                - heading \"Secure\" [level=3] [ref=e168]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e169]: Isolated browser instances to ensure data privacy and security.\n                  - listitem [ref=e170]: SOC-2 Type 1 and HIPAA compliant. Self-hosted available for ultimate control.\n                  - listitem [ref=e171]: Configurable logging options for maximum control of sensitive data.\n          - listitem [ref=e172]:\n            - button \"Observable Use our Live View iFrame to embed what's happening in the browser, and even let your users control the browser directly from your application. Browser session recording, source code capture, and command logging enables easy debugging of past sessions.\" [ref=e173] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e174]:\n                - img [ref=e175]\n                - heading \"Observable\" [level=3] [ref=e177]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e178]: Use our Live View iFrame to embed what's happening in the browser, and even let your users control the browser directly from your application.\n                  - listitem [ref=e179]: Browser session recording, source code capture, and command logging enables easy debugging of past sessions.\n          - listitem [ref=e180]:\n            - button \"Stealth Managed captcha solving, residential proxies, and fingerprint generation to keep your automations running smoothly. Our proxy super network intelligently picks the best proxy for your target. Configure anything, from browser fingerprint to proxy geolocation.\" [ref=e181] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e182]:\n                - img [ref=e183]\n                - heading \"Stealth\" [level=3] [ref=e185]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e186]: Managed captcha solving, residential proxies, and fingerprint generation to keep your automations running smoothly.\n                  - listitem [ref=e187]: Our proxy super network intelligently picks the best proxy for your target.\n                  - listitem [ref=e188]: Configure anything, from browser fingerprint to proxy geolocation.\n          - listitem [ref=e189]:\n            - button \"Extensible API support for File Uploads, Downloads, or Custom Browser Extensions. Use the Contexts API to persist cookies or other browser state across multiple sessions. First class SDKs available for Node.js and Python.\" [ref=e190] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e191]:\n                - img [ref=e192]\n                - heading \"Extensible\" [level=3] [ref=e194]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e195]: API support for File Uploads, Downloads, or Custom Browser Extensions.\n                  - listitem [ref=e196]: Use the Contexts API to persist cookies or other browser state across multiple sessions.\n                  - listitem [ref=e197]: First class SDKs available for Node.js and Python.\n          - listitem [ref=e198]:\n            - button \"Developer First Get started in minutes with our Browser Playground and Al Codegen feature to easily generate your first script. Comprehensive documentation with guides on performance, parallelization and authentication. Quick start guides in Node.js and Python.\" [ref=e199] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e200]:\n                - img [ref=e201]\n                - heading \"Developer First\" [level=3] [ref=e203]\n              - generic:\n                - list:\n                  - listitem [ref=e204]: Get started in minutes with our Browser Playground and Al Codegen feature to easily generate your first script.\n                  - listitem [ref=e205]: Comprehensive documentation with guides on performance, parallelization and authentication.\n                  - listitem [ref=e206]: Quick start guides in Node.js and Python.\n      - generic [ref=e208]:\n        - heading \"How it works\" [level=2] [ref=e209]\n        - paragraph [ref=e210]: Let's face it, managing infrastructure is the last thing you need on your plate. That's our job. Browserbase offers serverless browsers that are reliable, fast, and scalable. We manage the infrastructure so you can focus on building.\n      - generic [ref=e213]:\n        - heading \"Anything you do with a web browser, you can do with Browserbase\" [level=2] [ref=e214]\n        - generic [ref=e216]:\n          - list [ref=e217]:\n            - listitem [ref=e218]:\n              - button \"Browser tool for agents triangle\" [ref=e219] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e220]: Browser tool for agents\n                - img \"triangle\" [ref=e221]\n            - listitem [ref=e222]:\n              - button \"Workflow automation\" [ref=e223] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e224]: Workflow automation\n                - img [ref=e225]\n            - listitem [ref=e227]:\n              - button \"Web scraping\" [ref=e228] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e229]: Web scraping\n                - img [ref=e230]\n          - article [ref=e232]:\n            - generic [ref=e234]:\n              - list [ref=e235]:\n                - listitem [ref=e236]:\n                  - link \"Meet Stagehand\" [ref=e237] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.stagehand.dev\n                  - text: our open-source framework for building robust web agents.\n                - listitem [ref=e238]: Real-time human-in-the-loop controls using our Live View feature for enhanced oversight and flexibility.\n                - listitem [ref=e239]: Integrations with all major AI SDKs that work right out of the box.\n              - list [ref=e240]:\n                - listitem [ref=e241]:\n                  - link \"The breakthrough that allowed Coframe to revolutionize website optimization shadow-image\" [ref=e242] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/case-study-coframe\n                    - generic [ref=e243]:\n                      - text: The breakthrough that allowed Coframe to revolutionize website optimization\n                      - img [ref=e244]\n                    - img \"shadow-image\" [ref=e246]\n                - listitem [ref=e247]:\n                  - link \"How Aomni built an AI-powered sales intelligence platform using Browserbase shadow-image\" [ref=e248] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.browserbase.com/blog/case-study-aomni\n                    - generic [ref=e249]:\n                      - text: How Aomni built an AI-powered sales intelligence platform using Browserbase\n                      - img [ref=e250]\n                    - img \"shadow-image\" [ref=e252]\n      - generic [ref=e253]:\n        - heading \"Developer love\" [level=2] [ref=e254]\n        - generic [ref=e255]:\n          - article [ref=e256]:\n            - link \"Read more on Twitter\" [ref=e257] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: https://x.com/JacobColling/status/1876736737969389995\n              - img \"Jacob Colling profile image\" [ref=e258]\n            - link \"Read more on Twitter\" [ref=e259] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: https://x.com/JacobColling/status/1876736737969389995\n              - generic [ref=e260]: Jacob Colling\n              - generic [ref=e261]: \"@JacobColling\"\n              - img [ref=e262]\n            - paragraph [ref=e264]: Loving 🅱️ so far. Awesome product!\n          - article [ref=e265]:\n            - link \"Read more 