{"type":"message","id":"64ee119e","parentId":"2335b5f3","timestamp":"2026-02-24T05:02:01.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王，我已经打开了Browserbase的注册页面。现在需要您来填写注册信息：\n\n## 📝 需要填写的注册信息：\n\n1. **First name** - 名字\n2. **Last name** - 姓氏  \n3. **E-mail address** - 邮箱地址\n4. **Phone number** - 电话号码\n5. **Organization name** - 组织名称\n6. **Password** - 密码\n\n## 🎯 注册后会获得：\n- **BROWSERBASE_API_KEY** - 主要的API密钥\n- **BROWSERBASE_PROJECT_ID** - 项目ID（可选）\n\n## 🔧 后续配置：\n注册完成后，需要在命令行配置：\n```bash\nstagehand fn auth login\n# 或者手动设置环境变量\nexport BROWSERBASE_API_KEY=\"您的API密钥\"\nexport BROWSERBASE_PROJECT_ID=\"您的项目ID\"\n```\n\n请您填写注册表单，完成后告诉我，我帮您进行后续的配置工作。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":46096,"output":209,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46305,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771909296965}}
