{"type":"message","id":"89a4c3a0","parentId":"0d7f0077","timestamp":"2026-02-24T09:59:34.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ee2c86958d4c4604b6e07d03","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260224_05_网站身份信息请求集成方案.md","content":"\n## 🚀 立即行动步骤\n\n### 1. 测试目标网站\n首先需要分析目标网站的结构：\n\n```typescript\n// 网站分析函数\nasync function analyzeWebsite(url: string) {\n  const browser = await puppeteer.launch();\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  \n  await page.goto(url);\n  \n  // 分析页面结构\n  const pageStructure = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    return {\n      hasGenerateButton: !!document.querySelector('[id*=\"generate\"]'),\n      hasForm: !!document.querySelector('form'),\n      hasApi: !!document.querySelector('[data-api]'),\n      // 更多分析...\n    };\n  });\n  \n  await browser.close();\n  return pageStructure;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 选择合适的联系方式\n根据网站支持的验证方式选择：\n- **邮箱验证** - 使用临时邮箱服务\n- **短信验证** - 使用虚拟手机号\n- **无需验证** - 直接获取数据\n\n### 3. 实现请求唯一性\n确保每次请求都生成唯一的指纹和标识符。\n\n### 4. 设置监控机制\n实现验证码的自动监听和提取。\n\n**大王，我现在就可以开始分析 meiguodizhi.com 的具体结构，然后为您实现完整的自动化请求方案！**","append":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":88216,"output":361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88577,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771927130410}}
