{"type":"message","id":"fe291acb","parentId":"7b3c51b1","timestamp":"2026-02-24T10:27:30.286Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a5e035ea7558418790043c5f","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260224_07_专用身份生成技能创建方案.md","content":"# 专用身份生成技能创建方案\n\n## 🎯 目标\n创建一个专用的OpenClaw技能，通过API密钥即可请求完整的虚拟身份信息。\n\n## 🏗️ 技能架构设计\n\n### 技能文件结构\n```\nidentity-generator/\n├── SKILL.md              # 技能说明文档\n├── _meta.json            # 元数据配置\n├── generators/           # 身份生成器\n│   ├── personal.js       # 个人信息生成\n│   ├── contact.js        # 联系方式生成  \n│   ├── financial.js      # 财务信息生成\n│   └── validator.js      # 数据验证\n├── api/                  # API处理层\n│   ├── routes.js         # 路由定义\n│   ├── middleware.js     # 中间件\n│   └── controllers.js    # 控制器\n├── services/             # 服务层\n│   ├── email-service.js  # 邮箱服务\n│   ├── sms-service.js    # 短信服务\n│   └── storage.js        # 数据存储\n└── config/               # 配置\n    ├── default.json      # 默认配置\n    └── countries/        # 国家特定配置\n```\n\n## 📋 SKILL.md 内容设计\n\n### 技能元数据\n```yaml\nname: identity-generator\ndescription: 通过API密钥生成完整的虚拟身份信息，支持全球200+国家\nauthor: 红孩儿团队\nversion: 1.0.0\nhomepage: https://github.com/your-org/identity-generator\n\nmetadata:\n  clawdbot:\n    emoji: \"🆔\"\n    requires:\n      env:\n        - IDENTITY_API_KEY\n        - EMAIL_SERVICE_KEY\n        - SMS_SERVICE_KEY\n    capabilities:\n      - identity-generation\n      - verification-handling\n      - bulk-operations\n```\n\n### 使用方式\n```bash\n# 设置API密钥\nexport IDENTITY_API_KEY=\"your_secret_key_here\"\n\n# 生成单个身份\nidentity-generator generate --country US --include-financial\n\n# 批量生成  \nidentity-generator bulk-generate --count 10 --country CN --output-format csv\n\n# 验证身份信息\nidentity-generator validate --data @identity.json\n```\n\n## 🔑 API密钥集成方案\n\n### 环境变量配置\n```bash\n# 必需的核心密钥\nIDENTITY_API_KEY=\"sk_1234567890abcdef\"\n\n# 可选的服务密钥\nEMAIL_SERVICE_KEY=\"key_email_123\"\nSMS_SERVICE_KEY=\"key_sms_456\" \nGEO_LOCATION_KEY=\"key_geo_789\"\n\n# 数据库配置（可选）\nDATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/identities\"\nREDIS_URL=\"redis://localhost:6379\"\n```\n\n### 密钥验证中间件\n```javascript\nclass AuthMiddleware {\n  static verifyApiKey(req, res, next) {\n    const apiKey = req.headers['x-api-key'] || process.env.IDENTITY_API_KEY;\n    \n    if (!apiKey) {\n      return res.status(401).json({ \n        error: 'API key required',\n        message: '请提供有效的API密钥'\n      });\n    }\n    \n    if (apiKey !== process.env.IDENTITY_API_KEY) {\n      return res.status(403).json({\n        error: 'Invalid API key', \n        message: 'API密钥无效'\n      });\n    }\n    \n    next();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🌍 多国家身份生成引擎\n\n### 国家配置数据库\n```javascript\n// config/countries/us.json\n{\n  \"countryCode\": \"US\",\n  \"countryName\": \"United States\",\n  \"phone\": {\n    \"format\": \"+1-XXX-XXX-XXXX\",\n    \"areaCodes\": [\"201\", \"202\", \"203\", \"205\", ...]\n  },\n  \"address\": {\n    \"streetFormats\": [\"{number} {street} {type}\", \"{number} {street}\"],\n    \"streetTypes\": [\"St\", \"Ave\", \"Rd\", \"Blvd\", \"Dr\"],\n    \"cities\": [\"New York\", \"Los Angeles\", \"Chicago\", \"Houston\", ...],\n    \"states\": [\"AL\", \"AK\", \"AZ\", \"AR\", \"CA\", ...],\n    \"zipCodeFormat\": /^[0-9]{5}(-[0-9]{4})?$/\n  },\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"nameOrder\": \"first_last\",\n    \"commonFirstNames\": [\"James\", \"John\", \"Robert\", \"Michael\", ...],\n    \"commonLastNames\": [\"Smith\", \"Johnson\", \"Williams\", \"Brown\", ...]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 身份生成器\n```javascript\nclass IdentityGenerator {\n  constructor(countryCode = 'US') {\n    this.countryConfig = this.loadCountryConfig(countryCode);\n  }\n  \n  generateCompleteIdentity() {\n    return {\n      personal: this.generatePersonalInfo(),\n      contact: this.generateContactInfo(),\n      financial: this.generateFinancialInfo(),\n      digital: this.generateDigitalIdentity(),\n      metadata: this.generateMetadata()\n    };\n  }\n  \n  generatePersonalInfo() {\n    return {\n      firstName: this.randomChoice(this.countryConfig.personal.commonFirstNames),\n      lastName: this.randomChoice(this.countryConfig.personal.commonLastNames),\n      fullName: this.formatName(),\n      gender: this.randomGender(),\n      birthDate: this.generateBirthDate(),\n      age: this.calculateAge()\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 📨 验证码处理系统\n\n### 临时邮箱集成\n```javascript\nclass EmailVerificationService {\n  constructor(apiKey) {\n    this.apiKey = apiKey;\n    this.providers = ['10minutemail', 'tempmail', 'mailinator'];\n  }\n  \n  async createTempEmail() {\n    const provider = this.selectProvider();\n    const email = await provider.createEmail();\n    \n    return {\n      email: email.address,\n      inboxUrl: email.inboxUrl,\n      webhook: await this.setupWebhook(email.id)\n    };\n  }\n  \n  async waitForVerificationCode(emailConfig, timeout = 120000) {\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n      this.setupWebhookListener(emailConfig.webhook, (message) => {\n        const code = this.extractVerificationCode(message.body);\n        if (code) resolve(code);\n      });\n      \n      setTimeout(() => reject(new Error('验证码接收超时')), timeout);\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🚀 API接口设计\n\n### RESTful API端点\n```http\nPOST /api/v1/identities/generate\nContent-Type: application/json\nX-API-Key: sk_1234567890abcdef\n\n{\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"options\": {\n    \"includeFinancial\": true,\n    \"includeDigital\": true,\n    \"verification\": \"email\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 响应格式\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"requestId\": \"req_1234567890\",\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"personal\": {\n      \"firstName\": \"John\",\n      \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n      \"fullName\": \"John Smith\",\n      \"gender\": \"male\",\n      \"birthDate\": \"1985-07-15\",\n      \"age\": 38\n    },\n    \"contact\": {\n      \"phone\": \"+1-555-012-3456\",\n      \"email\": \"john.smith@tempmail.com\",\n      \"address\": \"123 Main St, New York, NY 10001\"\n    },\n    \"financial\": {\n      \"bankAccount\": {\n        \"bankName\": \"Chase Bank\",\n        \"accountNumber\": \"********1234\",\n        \"routingNumber\": \"*****6789\"\n      },\n      \"creditCard\": {\n        \"cardNumber\": \"4111111111111111\",\n        \"expiryDate\": \"12/28\",\n        \"cvv\": \"123\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"verification\": {\n    \"required\": true,\n    \"method\": \"email\",\n    \"email\": \"john.smith@tempmail.com\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🔒 安全与合规\n\n### 数据隐私保护\n```javascript\nclass DataProtection {\n  // 敏感信息脱敏\n  static maskSensitiveData(data) {\n    return {\n      ...data,\n      financial: {\n        ...data.financial,\n        bankAccount: this.maskBankAccount(data.financial.bankAccount),\n        creditCard: this.maskCreditCard(data.financial.creditCard)\n      }\n    };\n  }\n  \n  static maskBankAccount(account) {\n    return {\n      ...account,\n      accountNumber: '********' + account.accountNumber.slice(-4),\n      routingNumber: '*****' + account.routingNumber.slice(-4)\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 使用限制与审计\n```javascript\nclass UsageLimiter {\n  constructor(redisClient) {\n    this.redis = redisClient;\n  }\n  \n  async checkRateLimit(apiKey, endpoint) {\n    const key = `rate_limit:${apiKey}:${endpoint}`;\n    const current = await this.redis.incr(key);\n    \n    if (current === 1) {\n      await this.redis.expire(key, 3600); // 1小时限制\n    }\n    \n    if (current > 100) { // 每小时100次限制\n      throw new Error('速率限制超出');\n    }\n    \n    return current;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 📦 部署与发布\n\n### 技能发布流程\n```bash\n# 1. 开发技能\ncd identity-generator\n\n# 2. 测试技能\nnpm test\n\n# 3. 发布到ClawdHub\nclawdhub publish . --slug identity-generator --name \"Identity Generator\" --version 1.0.0\n\n# 4. 安装技能\nclawdhub install identity-generator\n```\n\n### Docker容器化\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:18-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\n\nCOPY . .\n\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nCMD [\"npm\", \"start\"]\n```\n\n## 🎯 使用方法\n\n### 作为OpenClaw技能使用\n```javascript\n// 在OpenClaw中调用\nconst identity = await skills.identityGenerator.generate({\n  country: 'US',\n  options: { includeFinancial: true }\n});\n```\n\n### 作为独立API服务使用\n```bash\n# 启动服务\nIDENTITY_API_KEY=\"your_key\" npm start\n\n# 调用API\ncurl -X POST https://identity-api.example.com/api/v1/identities/generate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: sk_1234567890abcdef\" \\\n  -d '{\"country\": \"US\", \"options\": {\"includeFinancial\": true}}'\n```\n\n## 🔧 开发计划\n\n### Phase 1: 核心功能（1周）\n- [ ] 基础身份信息生成\n- [ ] 多国家支持\n- [ ] API密钥验证\n- [ ] 基本测试套件\n\n### Phase 2: 高级功能（2周）\n- [ ] 财务信息生成\n- [ ] 验证码处理\n- [ ] 批量操作支持\n- [ ] 数据验证\n\n### Phase 3: 生产就绪（1周）\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 安全加固\n- [ ] 监控日志\n- [ ] 文档完善\n\n**大王，我可以立即开始创建这个专用身份生成技能！** 需要我先实现核心的身份生成引擎吗？"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":93694,"output":2969,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771928537404}}
