{"type":"message","id":"42d903c7","parentId":"d8f64b9f","timestamp":"2026-02-24T10:28:27.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                          ✅ **完全可以！** 大王，通过创建专用的OpenClaw技能，完全可以实现携带正确密钥通过API请求完整的虚拟身份信息。\n\n## 🎯 专用技能解决方案\n\n### 核心优势\n1. **开箱即用** - 安装技能即可使用，无需复杂配置\n2. **API驱动** - 通过RESTful API请求身份数据\n3. **密钥保护** - 使用API密钥进行认证和授权\n4. **完整数据** - 生成个人信息、联系方式、财务信息等全套资料\n\n## 🔧 技能架构设计\n\n### 技能组成\n```typescript\\nidentity-generator/\\n├── SKILL.md              # 技能说明\\n├── generators/           # 生成引擎\\n│   ├── personal.js       # 个人信息\\n│   ├── contact.js        # 联系方式\\n│   └── financial.js      # 财务信息\\n├── api/                  # API层\\n│   ├── routes.js         # 路由\\n│   └── controllers.js    # 控制器\\n└── services/             # 服务层\\n    ├── email-service.js  # 邮箱服务\\n    └── sms-service.js    # 短信服务\\n```\n\n### API调用方式\n```bash\\n# 设置API密钥\\nexport IDENTITY_API_KEY=\\\"your_secret_key\\\"\\n\\n# 生成身份信息\\nidentity-generator generate --country US --include-financial\\n```\n\n## 🗝️ 密钥配置示例\n\n### 环境变量配置\n```bash\\n# 核心API密钥\\nIDENTITY_API_KEY=\\\"sk_1234567890abcdef\\\"\\n\\n# 可选服务密钥  \\nEMAIL_SERVICE_KEY=\\\"key_email_123\\\"\\nSMS_SERVICE_KEY=\\\"key_sms_456\\\"\\nGEO_LOCATION_KEY=\\\"key_geo_789\\\"\\n```\n\n### API请求示例\n```http\\nPOST /api/v1/identities/generate\\nContent-Type: application/json\\nX-API-Key: sk_1234567890abcdef\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"country\\\": \\\"US\\\",\\n "}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1771928850303,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted"}}
