{"type":"message","id":"61ccf58f","parentId":"3a22a29a","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:07:24.155Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d423d180c79b41c8a030f986","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260224_08_网站与OpenClaw集成指南.md","content":"# 网站与OpenClaw集成指南\n\n## 🌐 网站端设置要求\n\n### 1. API接口设计\n```javascript\n// 身份生成API端点\napp.post('/api/v1/identities/generate', async (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    // 验证OpenClaw签名\n    const isValid = verifyOpenClawSignature(req);\n    if (!isValid) {\n      return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid signature' });\n    }\n    \n    // 处理生成请求\n    const identity = await generateIdentity(req.body);\n    \n    res.json({\n      status: 'success',\n      data: identity,\n      requestId: req.headers['x-request-id']\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ \n      error: 'Generation failed',\n      message: error.message \n    });\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 身份验证机制\n```javascript\n// OpenClaw请求验证\nfunction verifyOpenClawSignature(req) {\n  const signature = req.headers['x-openclaw-signature'];\n  const timestamp = req.headers['x-openclaw-timestamp'];\n  const nonce = req.headers['x-openclaw-nonce'];\n  \n  // 检查时间戳有效性（防止重放攻击）\n  if (Date.now() - parseInt(timestamp) > 300000) {\n    return false;\n  }\n  \n  // 验证签名\n  const expectedSignature = createSignature(timestamp, nonce, process.env.OPENCLAW_SECRET);\n  return signature === expectedSignature;\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 支持的功能端点\n```http\n# 身份生成\nPOST /api/v1/identities/generate\n\n# 批量生成  \nPOST /api/v1/identities/bulk-generate\n\n# 验证码处理\nPOST /api/v1/verification/request\nPOST /api/v1/verification/verify\n\n# 状态查询\nGET /api/v1/requests/:requestId/status\n```\n\n## 🔐 安全配置\n\n### 环境变量设置\n```bash\n# OpenClaw集成密钥\nOPENCLAW_API_KEY=sk_1234567890abcdef\nOPENCLAW_SECRET=your_shared_secret_here\n\n# 速率限制\nRATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS_PER_MINUTE=60\nRATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS_PER_HOUR=1000\n\n# CORS设置\nALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://openclaw.ai,https://*.openclaw.ai\n```\n\n### 速率限制中间件\n```javascript\nconst rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');\n\nconst openClawLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 60 * 1000, // 1分钟\n  max: 60, // 每分钟60个请求\n  message: {\n    error: 'Rate limit exceeded',\n    retryAfter: 60\n  },\n  skip: (req) => {\n    // 对OpenClaw请求应用不同的限制\n    return req.headers['user-agent']?.includes('OpenClaw');\n  }\n});\n\napp.use('/api/v1/', openClawLimiter);\n```\n\n## 📨 Webhook支持\n\n### 验证码回调Webhook\n```javascript\n// 接收验证码回调\napp.post('/webhook/openclaw/verification', async (req, res) => {\n  const { requestId, code, contactMethod, status } = req.body;\n  \n  // 验证Webhook签名\n  if (!verifyWebhookSignature(req)) {\n    return res.status(401).send('Invalid signature');\n  }\n  \n  // 处理验证码\n  await processVerificationCode(requestId, code, contactMethod);\n  \n  res.status(200).send('OK');\n});\n\n// 生成回调URL\nfunction generateCallbackUrl(requestId) {\n  return `https://your-website.com/webhook/openclaw/verification?requestId=${requestId}`;\n}\n```\n\n## 🗄️ 数据库设计\n\n### 请求记录表\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE openclaw_requests (\n  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n  request_id VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  api_key VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n  country_code VARCHAR(2) NOT NULL,\n  options JSONB,\n  status VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'pending',\n  identity_data JSONB,\n  verification_method VARCHAR(50),\n  contact_info VARCHAR(255),\n  verification_code VARCHAR(10),\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  completed_at TIMESTAMP\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_openclaw_requests_status ON openclaw_requests(status);\nCREATE INDEX idx_openclaw_requests_created ON openclaw_requests(created_at);\n```\n\n### API密钥管理表\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE api_keys (\n  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n  key VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  secret VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n  name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\n  description TEXT,\n  rate_limit_per_minute INTEGER DEFAULT 60,\n  rate_limit_per_hour INTEGER DEFAULT 1000,\n  enabled BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  last_used_at TIMESTAMP\n);\n```\n\n## 🔄 完整工作流\n\n### 1. 请求阶段\n```javascript\nasync function handleGenerationRequest(req, res) {\n  // 验证请求\n  const validation = validateRequest(req);\n  if (!validation.isValid) {\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: validation.error });\n  }\n  \n  // 创建请求记录\n  const requestRecord = await createRequestRecord({\n    requestId: generateRequestId(),\n    apiKey: req.headers['x-api-key'],\n    country: req.body.country,\n    options: req.body.options\n  });\n  \n  // 返回异步响应\n  res.json({\n    status: 'processing',\n    requestId: requestRecord.request_id,\n    estimatedTime: '30s'\n  });\n  \n  // 异步处理生成\n  processGeneration(requestRecord);\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 生成阶段\n```javascript\nasync function processGeneration(requestRecord) {\n  try {\n    // 生成身份信息\n    const identity = await generateIdentityData(requestRecord);\n    \n    // 如果需要验证\n    if (requiresVerification(requestRecord.options)) {\n      await initiateVerification(requestRecord, identity);\n    } else {\n      await completeRequest(requestRecord, identity);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    await failRequest(requestRecord, error.message);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 验证阶段\n```javascript\nasync function initiateVerification(requestRecord, identity) {\n  // 选择验证方式\n  const verificationMethod = selectVerificationMethod(requestRecord.options);\n  \n  // 设置联系方式\n  const contactInfo = await setupContactMethod(verificationMethod);\n  \n  // 发送验证码\n  const verificationCode = await sendVerificationCode(contactInfo);\n  \n  // 更新请求状态\n  await updateRequest(requestRecord.id, {\n    status: 'verification_pending',\n    verification_method: verificationMethod,\n    contact_info: contactInfo,\n    verification_code: verificationCode\n  });\n  \n  // 设置超时\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    expireVerification(requestRecord.id);\n  }, 300000); // 5分钟超时\n}\n```\n\n## 🌍 多语言和多国家支持\n\n### 国家配置\n```javascript\nconst countryConfigs = {\n  US: {\n    name: 'United States',\n    phone: {\n      format: '+1-XXX-XXX-XXXX',\n      areaCodes: ['201', '202', '203', '205']\n    },\n    address: {\n      format: '{number} {street} {type}',\n      streetTypes: ['St', 'Ave', 'Rd', 'Blvd']\n    }\n  },\n  CN: {\n    name: 'China',\n    phone: {\n      format: '+86 XXX XXXX XXXX',\n      areaCodes: ['010', '021', '022', '023']\n    },\n    address: {\n      format: '{province}{city}{district}{street}{number}',\n      streetTypes: ['路', '街', '大道', '巷']\n    }\n  }\n  // ... 更多国家\n};\n```\n\n### 本地化响应\n```javascript\nfunction getLocalizedResponse(lang = 'en') {\n  const messages = {\n    en: {\n      success: 'Identity generated successfully',\n      processing: 'Your request is being processed',\n      verification_required: 'Verification code sent'\n    },\n    zh: {\n      success: '身份信息生成成功',\n      processing: '您的请求正在处理中',\n      verification_required: '验证码已发送'\n    },\n    ja: {\n      success: '身份情報が正常に生成されました',\n      processing: 'リクエストを処理中です',\n      verification_required: '確認コードを送信しました'\n    }\n  };\n  \n  return messages[lang] || messages.en;\n}\n```\n\n## 📊 监控和日志\n\n### 请求日志\n```javascript\nfunction logOpenClawRequest(req, response, duration) {\n  const logEntry = {\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    requestId: req.headers['x-request-id'],\n    apiKey: req.headers['x-api-key'],\n    endpoint: req.path,\n    method: req.method,\n    statusCode: response.statusCode,\n    duration: duration,\n    userAgent: req.headers['user-agent'],\n    ip: req.ip,\n    country: req.body?.country,\n    error: response.statusCode >= 400 ? response.body?.error : undefined\n  };\n  \n  // 写入日志系统\n  logger.info('OpenClaw API Request', logEntry);\n}\n```\n\n### 性能监控\n```javascript\nconst monitor = require('prom-client');\n\n// 创建指标\nconst openClawRequests = new monitor.Counter({\n  name: 'openclaw_requests_total',\n  help: 'Total OpenClaw API requests',\n  labelNames: ['endpoint', 'status']\n});\n\nconst requestDuration = new monitor.Histogram({\n  name: 'openclaw_request_duration_seconds',\n  help: 'OpenClaw API request duration',\n  labelNames: ['endpoint']\n});\n```\n\n## 🚀 部署配置\n\n### Docker配置\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:18-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# 安装依赖\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\n\n# 复制源码\nCOPY . .\n\n# 设置环境变量\nENV NODE_ENV=production\nENV PORT=3000\n\n# 暴露端口\nEXPOSE 3000\n\n# 启动应用\nCMD [\"npm\", \"start\"]\n```\n\n### Kubernetes部署\n```yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: identity-api\nspec:\n  replicas: 3\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: identity-api\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: identity-api\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: identity-api\n        image: your-registry/identity-api:latest\n        ports:\n        - containerPort: 3000\n        env:\n        - name: OPENCLAW_SECRET\n          valueFrom:\n            secretKeyRef:\n              name: api-secrets\n              key: openclaw-secret\n        resources:\n          limits:\n            cpu: \"1\"\n            memory: \"512Mi\"\n          requests:\n            cpu: \"500m\"\n            memory: \"256Mi\"\n```\n\n## 🔧 测试和验证\n\n### API测试套件\n```javascript\ndescribe('OpenClaw API Integration', () => {\n  it('should generate identity with valid API key', async () => {\n    const response = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/v1/identities/generate')\n      .set('X-API-Key', process.env.TEST_API_KEY)\n      .send({ country: 'US' });\n    \n    expect(response.status).toBe(200);\n    expect(response.body).toHaveProperty('requestId');\n    expect(response.body.status).toBe('processing');\n  });\n  \n  it('should reject invalid API key', async () => {\n    const response = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/v1/identities/generate')\n      .set('X-API-Key', 'invalid-key')\n      .send({ country: 'US' });\n    \n    expect(response.status).toBe(403);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 性能测试\n```bash\n# 使用artillery进行负载测试\nartillery run load-test.yml\n\n# load-test.yml 配置\nconfig:\n  target: \"https://your-api.com\"\n  phases:\n    - duration: 60\n      arrivalRate: 10\n      name: \"Warm up\"\n    - duration: 120\n      arrivalRate: 50\n      name: \"Sustained load\"\nscenarios:\n  - flow:\n    - post:\n        url: \"/api/v1/identities/generate\"\n        headers:\n          X-API-Key: \"{{ $processEnvironment.TEST_API_KEY }}\"\n        json:\n          country: \"US\"\n```\n\n## 📝 最佳实践\n\n### 安全性最佳实践\n1. **使用HTTPS** - 所有通信必须加密\n2. **密钥轮换** - 定期更换API密钥\n3. **输入验证** - 严格验证所有输入参数\n4. **输出过滤** - 过滤敏感信息在响应中\n5. **错误处理** - 避免泄露敏感错误信息\n\n### 性能最佳实践\n1. **缓存响应** - 缓存频繁请求的结果\n2. **数据库索引** - 优化查询性能\n3. **连接池** - 使用数据库连接池\n4. **异步处理** - 长时间操作异步处理\n5. **负载均衡** - 使用多实例负载均衡\n\n**大王，您的网站只需要实现这些API端点，就可以完美与OpenClaw配合使用了！** 需要我帮您实现具体的代码吗？"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":97818,"output":3532,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101350,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771930852769}}
