{"type":"message","id":"32c17d4c","parentId":"f24c853a","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:10:24.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王，您的网站需要设置以下内容才能与OpenClaw完美配合：\n\n## 🎯 核心API端点设置\n\n### 1. **身份生成端点**（必需）\n```javascript\n// POST /api/v1/identities/generate\napp.post('/api/v1/identities/generate', async (req, res) => {\n  // 验证OpenClaw请求\n  const isValid = await verifyOpenClawRequest(req);\n  if (!isValid) return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid signature' });\n  \n  // 生成身份信息\n  const identity = await generateIdentity(req.body);\n  \n  res.json({\n    status: 'success',\n    data: identity,\n    requestId: generateRequestId()\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. **批量生成端点**（推荐）\n```javascript\n// POST /api/v1/identities/bulk-generate\napp.post('/api/v1/identities/bulk-generate', async (req, res) => {\n  const { count, country, options } = req.body;\n  const identities = [];\n  \n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    identities.push(await generateIdentity({ country, ...options }));\n  }\n  \n  res.json({ identities });\n});\n```\n\n## 🔐 安全认证配置\n\n### 环境变量设置\n```bash\n# 必需的安全配置\nOPENCLAW_API_KEY=sk_您的唯一标识密钥\nOPENCLAW_SECRET=您的共享密钥（用于签名验证）\nRATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60\n\n# 可选配置\nALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://openclaw.ai,https://*.openclaw.ai\nSESSION_TIMEOUT=300000  # 5分钟\n```\n\n### 请求验证中间件\n```javascript\nconst verifyOpenClawRequest = async (req) => {\n  const signature = req.headers['x-openclaw-signature'];\n  const timestamp = req.headers['x-openclaw-timestamp'];\n  const apiKey = req.headers['x-api-key'];\n  \n  // 检查API密钥\n  if (apiKey !== process.env.OPENCLAW_API_KEY) {\n    return false;\n  }\n  \n  // 检查时间戳（防止重放攻击）\n  if (Date.now() - parseInt(timestamp) > 300000) {\n    return false;\n  }\n  \n  // 验证签名\n  const expectedSignature = createSignature(\n    timestamp, \n    req.body, \n    process.env.OPENCLAW_SECRET\n  );\n  \n  return signature === expectedSignature;\n};\n```\n\n## 📨 Webhook支持（用于验证码）\n\n### 验证码回调端点\n```javascript\n// POST /webhook/openclaw/verification\napp.post('/webhook/openclaw/verification', async (req, res) => {\n  const { requestId, code, status } = req.body;\n  \n  // 更新验证状态\n  await updateVerificationStatus(requestId, code, status);\n  \n  res.status(200).send('OK');\n});\n```\n\n## 🌍 多国家支持配置\n\n### 国家特定规则\n```javascript\nconst countryRules = {\n  US: {\n    phone: { format: '+1-XXX-XXX-XXXX', areaCodes: ['201', '202'] },\n    address: { format: '{number} {street} {type}', streetTypes: ['St', 'Ave'] }\n  },\n  CN: {\n    phone: { format: '+86 XXX XXXX XXXX', areaCodes: ['010', '021'] },\n    address: { format: '{province}{city}{district}{street}{number}' }\n  }\n  // 更多国家...\n};\n```\n\n## 📊 数据库设计建议\n\n### 请求记录表\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE openclaw_requests (\n  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,\n  request_id VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE,\n  api_key VARCHAR(255),\n  country_code VARCHAR(2),\n  status VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'pending',\n  identity_data JSONB,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n);\n```\n\n## 🚀 快速启动步骤\n\n1. **创建API端点** - 实现 `/api/v1/identities/generate`\n2. **配置环境变量** - 设置安全密钥和限制\n3. **实现请求验证** - 确保请求合法性\n4. **测试集成** - 使用OpenClaw测试调用\n\n## 💡 最佳实践\n\n1. **使用HTTPS** - 所有通信必须加密\n2. **速率限制** - 防止滥用\n3. **输入验证** - 验证所有输入参数\n4. **错误处理** - 友好的错误信息\n5. **日志记录** - 记录所有请求\n\n**大王，您的网站只需要实现这些API端点并配置好安全设置，就可以立即与OpenClaw配合使用了！** 需要我帮您编写具体的代码实现吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":99069,"output":1049,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100118,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771931312635}}
