{"type":"message","id":"ed0ad9c7","parentId":"6eb1a23c","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:15:43.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                        大王，您的网站只需要**5分钟**和**20行代码**就能设置好与OpenClaw的集成！\n\n## 🚀 最简设置方案\n\n### 1. 创建单个API端点\n```javascript\n// app.js\nconst express = require('express');\nconst app = express();\napp.use(express.json());\n\napp.post('/api/identities/generate', (req, res) => {\n  // 验证API密钥\n  if (req.headers['x-api-key'] !== process.env.OPENCLAW_KEY) {\n    return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid key' });\n  }\n  \n  // 生成身份信息\n  const identity = {\n    name: 'Test User',\n    phone: '+1-555-0123-4567', \n    email: 'test@example.com',\n    address: '123 Test St, Test City'\n  };\n  \n  res.json({ status: 'success', data: identity });\n});\n\napp.listen(3000, () => console.log('Server ready for OpenClaw!'));\n```\n\n### 2. 设置环境变量\n```bash\n# .env 文件\nOPENCLAW_KEY=sk_your_secret_key_here\n```\n\n### 3. 安装依赖\n```bash\nnpm install express\n```\n\n### 4. 启动服务\n```bash\nnode app.js\n```\n\n## 🔑 OpenClaw端配置\n\n在OpenClaw中这样调用：\n```javascript\nconst response = await fetch('https://您的网站.com/api/identities/generate', {\n  method: 'POST',\n  headers: {\n    'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n    'X-API-Key': 'sk_your_secret_key_here'\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({ country: 'US' })\n});\n```\n\n## 🎯 立即测试\n\n用这个命令测试您的API：\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://您的网站.com/api/identities/generate \\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: sk_your_secret_key_here\\\" \\\n  -d '{\\\"country\\\": \\\"US\\\"}'\n```\n\n**这样就可以了！** 您的网站现在就能接收OpenClaw的请求并返回身份信息了。需要我帮您设置具体的服务器吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":103186,"output":494,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103680,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771931644511}}
