{"type":"message","id":"fe2aede6","parentId":"2c3e5c5d","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:29:32.528Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                          ✅ **完全可以！** 使用哈希值作为验证机制是绝佳的安全方案！\n\n## 🔐 哈希验证方案\n\n### 核心验证流程\n```javascript\n// 1. 生成身份信息时计算哈希\nconst identity = generateIdentity('US');\nconst contentHash = sha256(JSON.stringify(identity));\n\n// 2. 基于哈希生成验证密钥  \nconst verificationKey = deriveKeyFromHash(contentHash);\n\n// 3. 返回给客户端\nreturn {\n    data: identity,\n    hash: contentHash,\n    signature: sign(identity, verificationKey)\n};\n```\n\n### 验证过程\n```javascript\n// 客户端验证\nfunction verifyResponse(response) {\n    // 重新计算哈希\n    const expectedHash = sha256(JSON.stringify(response.data));\n    \n    // 对比哈希值\n    if (expectedHash !== response.hash) {\n        throw new Error('数据被篡改！');\n    }\n    \n    // 验证签名\n    const expectedKey = deriveKeyFromHash(response.hash);\n    return verifySignature(response.data, response.signature, expectedKey);\n}\n```\n\n## 🎯 方案优势\n\n### 1. **内容绑定安全**\n- 每个身份信息都有唯一哈希\n- 密钥基于内容生成，无法预测\n- 数据改动立即检测到\n\n### 2. **零知识验证**\n- 不需要存储密钥数据库\n- 验证仅依赖内容本身\n- 完全去中心化验证\n\n### 3. **防重放攻击**\n```javascript\n// 添加时间戳防止重放\nconst hash = sha256(JSON.stringify(identity) + Date.now());\n```\n\n## 🚀 立即实现\n\n### 前端哈希生成\n```html\n<script src=\\\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/crypto-js/4.1.1/crypto-js.min.js\\\"></script>\n<script>\nfunction generateHash(content) {\n    return CryptoJS.SHA256(JSON.stringify(content)).toString();\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### OpenClaw验证\n```javascript\n// 在OpenClaw中验证响应\nconst isValid = await verifyHashSignature(response.data, response.hash, response.signature);\n```\n\n**大王，哈希验证是最佳方案！** 既安全又简单，我现在就可以为您实现完整的哈希验证系统！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":106328,"output":483,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106811,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771932464134}}
{"type":"message","id":"2eb01365","parentId":"fe2aede6","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:31:44.022Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"ab416196-d98f-4a13-b29b-1bbe43dc4200\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-02-24 19:31 GMT+8] 请完整告诉我，这样的一个前端网站生成了你如何通过API请求，获得生成的虚拟身份信息，或者携带指令发出新的需求。你是用专用的的skill来发出请求的，这个skills如何设计给出标准文档，网站那边用哈希值做验证，如何设置API，如何和你对接通讯，交互生成新的身份信息。详细告诉我。分开阐述。网站的要单独说有条理。"}],"timestamp":1771932704010}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8cfda6d","parentId":"2eb01365","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:34:39.492Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2e2de4c947464a42901c01ed","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260224_12_OpenClaw专用身份技能设计.md","content":"# OpenClaw专用身份技能设计\n\n## 🎯 技能设计标准\n\n### SKILL.md 标准文档\n```yaml\nname: identity-generator\ndescription: 通过API请求生成虚拟身份信息，支持哈希验证\nauthor: 红孩儿团队\nversion: 1.0.0\nhomepage: https://github.com/your-org/identity-generator\n\nmetadata:\n  clawdbot:\n    emoji: \"🆔\"\n    requires:\n      env:\n        - IDENTITY_API_KEY\n        - IDENTITY_API_URL\n      bins:\n        - curl\n    capabilities:\n      - identity-generation\n      - hash-verification\n      - bulk-operations\n\n# API配置\napi:\n  base_url: \"{{process.env.IDENTITY_API_URL}}\"\n  endpoints:\n    generate: \"/api/v1/identities/generate\"\n    bulk_generate: \"/api/v1/identities/bulk-generate\"\n    verify: \"/api/v1/verification/verify\"\n\n# 哈希验证配置\nhash_verification:\n  algorithm: \"sha256\"\n  salt: \"{{process.env.HASH_SALT}}\"\n  key_derivation: \"hkdf\"\n```\n\n## 🔧 技能实现代码\n\n### identity-generator.js\n```javascript\nconst { tool } = require('@openclaw/core');\n\nclass IdentityGenerator {\n  constructor() {\n    this.apiKey = process.env.IDENTITY_API_KEY;\n    this.apiUrl = process.env.IDENTITY_API_URL;\n    this.hashSalt = process.env.HASH_SALT || 'default-salt';\n  }\n\n  // 生成单个身份\n  async generateIdentity(options = {}) {\n    const response = await this.makeRequest('/generate', {\n      country: options.country || 'US',\n      includeFinancial: options.includeFinancial || false,\n      verificationMethod: options.verificationMethod || 'email'\n    });\n\n    // 验证哈希\n    if (!await this.verifyHash(response.data, response.hash, response.signature)) {\n      throw new Error('Hash verification failed');\n    }\n\n    return response.data;\n  }\n\n  // 批量生成\n  async generateIdentities(count, options = {}) {\n    const response = await this.makeRequest('/bulk-generate', {\n      count: count,\n      ...options\n    });\n\n    // 验证每个身份的哈希\n    for (const item of response.data) {\n      if (!await this.verifyHash(item.identity, item.hash, item.signature)) {\n        throw new Error(`Hash verification failed for identity ${item.requestId}`);\n      }\n    }\n\n    return response.data;\n  }\n\n  // API请求封装\n  async makeRequest(endpoint, data) {\n    const url = `${this.apiUrl}${endpoint}`;\n    \n    const response = await fetch(url, {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        'X-API-Key': this.apiKey,\n        'X-Request-ID': this.generateRequestId()\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify(data)\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      throw new Error(`API request failed: ${response.status}`);\n    }\n\n    return await response.json();\n  }\n\n  // 哈希验证\n  async verifyHash(data, receivedHash, signature) {\n    // 计算期望哈希\n    const expectedHash = this.calculateHash(data);\n    \n    if (expectedHash !== receivedHash) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    // 验证签名\n    const verificationKey = this.deriveKeyFromHash(receivedHash);\n    const expectedSignature = this.calculateSignature(data, verificationKey);\n    \n    return expectedSignature === signature;\n  }\n\n  // 计算哈希\n  calculateHash(data) {\n    const content = typeof data === 'string' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n    return crypto.createHash('sha256').update(content + this.hashSalt).digest('hex');\n  }\n\n  // 从哈希派生密钥\n  deriveKeyFromHash(hash) {\n    return crypto.createHmac('sha256', this.hashSalt)\n                 .update(hash)\n                 .digest('hex')\n                 .substring(0, 32);\n  }\n\n  // 计算签名\n  calculateSignature(data, key) {\n    const content = typeof data === 'string' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n    return crypto.createHmac('sha256', key)\n                 .update(content)\n                 .digest('hex');\n  }\n\n  generateRequestId() {\n    return `req_${Date.now()}_${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\n  }\n}\n\n// 导出工具\nmodule.exports = {\n  tools: {\n    generate_identity: {\n      description: 'Generate a virtual identity with hash verification',\n      parameters: {\n        country: { type: 'string', default: 'US' },\n        includeFinancial: { type: 'boolean', default: false },\n        verificationMethod: { type: 'string', enum: ['email', 'sms'], default: 'email' }\n      },\n      execute: async ({ country, includeFinancial, verificationMethod }) => {\n        const generator = new IdentityGenerator();\n        return await generator.generateIdentity({\n          country,\n          includeFinancial,\n          verificationMethod\n        });\n      }\n    },\n    \n    generate_identities: {\n      description: 'Generate multiple virtual identities',\n      parameters: {\n        count: { type: 'number', minimum: 1, maximum: 100 },\n        country: { type: 'string', default: 'US' },\n        includeFinancial: { type: 'boolean', default: false }\n      },\n      execute: async ({ count, country, includeFinancial }) => {\n        const generator = new IdentityGenerator();\n        return await generator.generateIdentities(count, {\n          country,\n          includeFinancial\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\n## 🌐 网站端API设置\n\n### 网站API设计（单独阐述）\n\n#### 1. API端点设计\n```javascript\n// app.js - 网站API服务器\nconst express = require('express');\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst app = express();\n\napp.use(express.json());\n\n// 环境变量配置\nconst API_KEY = process.env.API_KEY || 'sk_default_key';\nconst HASH_SALT = process.env.HASH_SALT || 'default-salt';\n\n// 身份生成端点\napp.post('/api/v1/identities/generate', async (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    // 验证API密钥\n    const apiKey = req.headers['x-api-key'];\n    if (apiKey !== API_KEY) {\n      return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid API key' });\n    }\n\n    // 生成身份信息\n    const identity = generateIdentity(req.body.country || 'US');\n    \n    // 计算哈希\n    const contentHash = calculateHash(identity);\n    \n    // 生成验证密钥\n    const verificationKey = deriveKeyFromHash(contentHash);\n    \n    // 生成签名\n    const signature = calculateSignature(identity, verificationKey);\n\n    res.json({\n      status: 'success',\n      data: identity,\n      hash: contentHash,\n      signature: signature,\n      requestId: req.headers['x-request-id'] || generateRequestId()\n    });\n\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({\n      error: 'Generation failed',\n      message: error.message\n    });\n  }\n});\n\n// 批量生成端点\napp.post('/api/v1/identities/bulk-generate', async (req, res) => {\n  // 类似的实现，支持批量操作\n});\n```\n\n#### 2. 哈希验证函数\n```javascript\n// hash-utils.js - 哈希相关函数\nfunction calculateHash(data) {\n  const content = typeof data === 'string' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n  return crypto.createHash('sha256')\n               .update(content + HASH_SALT)\n               .digest('hex');\n}\n\nfunction deriveKeyFromHash(hash) {\n  return crypto.createHmac('sha256', HASH_SALT)\n               .update(hash)\n               .digest('hex')\n               .substring(0, 32);\n}\n\nfunction calculateSignature(data, key) {\n  const content = typeof data === 'string' ? data : JSON.stringify(data);\n  return crypto.createHmac('sha256', key)\n               .update(content)\n               .digest('hex');\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. 身份生成逻辑\n```javascript\n// identity-generator.js - 身份生成核心\nfunction generateIdentity(country = 'US') {\n  const countries = {\n    US: {\n      firstName: ['John', 'Jane', 'Robert', 'Mary'],\n      lastName: ['Smith', 'Johnson', 'Williams', 'Brown'],\n      phoneFormat: '+1-555-###-####',\n      addressFormat: '{number} {street} {type}'\n    },\n    CN: {\n      firstName: ['伟', '芳', '娜', '强'],\n      lastName: ['王', '李', '张', '刘'],\n      phoneFormat: '+86 138########',\n      addressFormat: '{province}{city}{district}{street}'\n    }\n  };\n\n  const config = countries[country] || countries.US;\n  \n  return {\n    personal: {\n      firstName: randomChoice(config.firstName),\n      lastName: randomChoice(config.lastName),\n      fullName: `${randomChoice(config.firstName)} ${randomChoice(config.lastName)}`,\n      gender: Math.random() > 0.5 ? 'male' : 'female',\n      birthDate: generateBirthDate(),\n      age: randomInt(18, 65)\n    },\n    contact: {\n      email: generateEmail(),\n      phone: generatePhoneNumber(config.phoneFormat),\n      address: generateAddress(config.addressFormat)\n    },\n    metadata: {\n      country: country,\n      generatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n      isTestData: true\n    }\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## 🔄 交互通信流程\n\n### 1. OpenClaw发起请求\n```javascript\n// OpenClaw技能调用流程\nconst identity = await tools.generate_identity({\n  country: 'US',\n  includeFinancial: true,\n  verificationMethod: 'email'\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 网站处理请求\n```http\nPOST /api/v1/identities/generate\nContent-Type: application/json\nX-API-Key: sk_actual_api_key_here\nX-Request-ID: req_1234567890\n\n{\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"includeFinancial\": true,\n  \"verificationMethod\": \"email\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 网站响应\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"personal\": {\n      \"firstName\": \"John\",\n      \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n      \"fullName\": \"John Smith\",\n      \"gender\": \"male\",\n      \"birthDate\": \"1985-07-15\",\n      \"age\": 38\n    },\n    \"contact\": {\n      \"email\": \"john.smith@example.com\",\n      \"phone\": \"+1-555-012-3456\",\n      \"address\": \"123 Main St, New York, NY\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"hash\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f6...\",\n  \"signature\": \"signature_value_here\",\n  \"requestId\": \"req_1234567890\"\n}\n```\n\n### 4. OpenClaw验证响应\n```javascript\n// 自动验证哈希和签名\nif (hash !== calculateHash(data)) {\n  throw new Error('Data integrity check failed');\n}\n\nif (signature !== calculateSignature(data, deriveKeyFromHash(hash))) {\n  throw new Error('Signature verification failed');\n}\n```\n\n## 🛡️ 安全配置\n\n### OpenClaw环境变量\n```bash\n# .env 文件\nIDENTITY_API_KEY=sk_your_actual_api_key\nIDENTITY_API_URL=https://your-api.com/api/v1\nHASH_SALT=your-super-secret-salt-value\n```\n\n### 网站环境变量\n```bash\n# 网站 .env 文件\nAPI_KEY=sk_your_actual_api_key\nHASH_SALT=your-super-secret-salt-value\nPORT=3000\nNODE_ENV=production\n```\n\n## 🚀 部署和测试\n\n### OpenClaw技能安装\n```bash\n# 安装技能\nclawdhub install identity-generator\n\n# 配置环境变量\nexport IDENTITY_API_KEY=sk_your_key\nexport IDENTITY_API_URL=https://your-api.com\nexport HASH_SALT=your-secret-salt\n```\n\n### 网站部署\n```bash\n# 安装依赖\nnpm install express crypto\n\n# 启动服务器\nnode app.js\n```\n\n### 测试命令\n```bash\n# 测试API\ncurl -X POST https://your-api.com/api/v1/identities/generate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: sk_your_key\" \\\n  -d '{\"country\": \"US\"}'\n```\n\n## 📋 完整工作流程\n\n1. **技能配置** - 设置API密钥和URL\n2. **请求发起** - OpenClaw调用生成功能\n3. **API处理** - 网站验证并生成身份\n4. **哈希计算** - 网站计算内容哈希和签名\n5. **响应返回** - 返回身份数据+哈希+签名\n6. **验证验证** - OpenClaw验证数据完整性\n7. **结果使用** - 使用验证通过的身份数据\n\n**大王，这样设计就完整了！** 网站提供标准的API接口，OpenClaw通过专用技能调用，双方通过哈希验证确保数据安全。"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":106981,"output":3446,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110427,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771932704020}}
