{"type":"message","id":"848ff80a","parentId":"6364eb27","timestamp":"2026-02-24T11:41:20.977Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7dfce428aecf4b4b945c0ad9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260224_13_网站API设置指南.md","content":"API密钥\",\n  \"code\": \"UNAUTHORIZED\"\n}\n```\n\n## 🔧 测试方法\n\n### curl测试命令\n```bash\n# 测试身份生成\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/identities/generate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: sk_your_secret_key_here\" \\\n  -d '{\"country\": \"US\", \"includeFinancial\": true}'\n\n# 测试批量生成\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/identities/bulk-generate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: sk_your_secret_key_here\" \\\n  -d '{\"count\": 5, \"country\": \"CN\"}'\n\n# 测试健康检查\ncurl http://localhost:3000/health\n```\n\n### 自动化测试\n```javascript\n// test/api.test.js\nconst request = require('supertest');\nconst app = require('../app');\n\ndescribe('Identity API', () => {\n  it('should generate identity with valid API key', async () => {\n    const response = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/v1/identities/generate')\n      .set('X-API-Key', process.env.API_KEY)\n      .send({ country: 'US' });\n    \n    expect(response.status).toBe(200);\n    expect(response.body).toHaveProperty('data.personal.firstName');\n    expect(response.body).toHaveProperty('hash');\n    expect(response.body).toHaveProperty('signature');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## 🎯 总结\n\n### 网站需要实现的核心功能\n1. **API端点** - `/api/v1/identities/generate` 和批量生成端点\n2. **身份生成** - 支持多国家的虚拟身份生成\n3. **哈希计算** - 基于内容生成唯一哈希值\n4. **签名生成** - 使用哈希派生的密钥生成数字签名\n5. **安全验证** - API密钥验证和速率限制\n\n### 部署要求\n1. **Node.js环境** - 版本16+\n2. **环境变量** - API密钥和哈希盐值\n3. **网络访问** - 允许OpenClaw服务器访问\n4. **HTTPS支持** - 生产环境建议使用HTTPS\n\n**大王，您的网站按照这个指南设置，就可以完美与OpenClaw对接了！** 所有代码都是完整的，可以直接使用。","append":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-